{{Faction | faction = Children of the Vine | image1 = | caption-image1 = | nickname = | philosophy = Nothing should be denied. | founded = | factol = | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Arborea]] | allies = [[Society of Sensation]] | enemies = | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Children of the Vine''' are a [[sect]], technically an offshoot of the [[Society of Sensation]]. They merge the Sensate ideal with the worst impulsiveness of the [[Transcendent Order]]: No impulse should be resisted. Even fleeting whims are equivalent to a sage's deepest ponderings.
== History ==
== Philosophy ==
While the Society of Sensation curate a well-rounded individual, taking in experiences of all types, the Children of the Vine trend towards the wildly hedonistic. They do not believe in love or art, focusing instead on blissful drunken revelry. Only by denying themselves nothing can they gain everything.
== Role ==
== Membership == : ''See also:'' [[List of Children of the Vine members]]
[[Satyr]]s, [[nymph]]s, [[bacchus|bacchae]], and dissolute bubbers make up the bulk of their followers.
== Background Information ==
== References == * 2nd Edition ** {{b|Planescape|Planes of Chaos|pdf=17298|page=40, The Book of Chaos}} ** {{b|Planescape|In the Cage: A Guide to Sigil|pdf=17274|page=14}}
